                <div class="form-body">
                    <div class="pcc-instructions">
                        <b>Instrucción operativa PCC1B</b>
                        <p>Monitorear visualmente el 100% de las canales. Registrar por lado <b>I</b> (izquierdo) o <b>D</b> (derecho), seleccionar todos los hallazgos y cuadrantes aplicables, indicar la acción correctiva con <b>√</b> o <b>X</b>, la reinspección <b>SC / NC</b> y la verificación <b>C:</b> con <b>√</b> cuando cumple.</p>
                    </div>

                    <span class="label">Canal y lado monitoreado</span>
                    <div class="selection-box">
                        <div class="selection-number" id="selectedQuadrantNumber">1</div>
                        <div style="min-width:0"><div class="selection-name" id="selectedQuadrantName">Cuadrante 1</div><div class="selection-code" id="selectedChannelCode">CNL-025481</div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="choice-row two" id="sideRow">
                        <button type="button" class="choice-btn active" data-side="I"><b>I</b><span>Izquierdo</span></button>
                        <button type="button" class="choice-btn" data-side="D"><b>D</b><span>Derecho</span></button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-line"><span class="label" style="margin:0">Hallazgos de contaminantes</span><button type="button" class="no-findings-btn" id="noFindingsBtn">✓ Sin hallazgos</button></div>
                    <div class="damage-grid finding-grid" id="damageGrid">
                        <button type="button" class="damage-btn" data-finding="A"><span class="finding-code">A</span>Ingesta / alimento</button>
                        <button type="button" class="damage-btn" data-finding="MF"><span class="finding-code">MF</span>Materia fecal</button>
                        <button type="button" class="damage-btn" data-finding="L"><span class="finding-code">L</span>Leche</button>
                        <button type="button" class="damage-btn" data-finding="Pelo"><span class="damage-icon">〰</span>Pelo</button>
                        <button type="button" class="damage-btn" data-finding="Hematomas"><span class="damage-icon">🩸</span>Hematomas</button>
                        <button type="button" class="damage-btn" data-finding="Adherencias"><span class="damage-icon">⛓</span>Adherencias</button>
                        <button type="button" class="damage-btn" data-finding="Víscera roja"><span class="damage-icon">🔴</span>Víscera roja</button>
                        <button type="button" class="damage-btn" data-finding="Víscera verde"><span class="damage-icon">🟢</span>Víscera verde</button>
                        <button type="button" class="damage-btn" data-finding="Piel"><span class="damage-icon">◩</span>Piel</button>
                        <button type="button" class="damage-btn" data-finding="Espinas"><span class="damage-icon">✦</span>Espinas</button>
                        <button type="button" class="damage-btn" data-finding="Otro"><span class="damage-icon">✍</span>Otro</button>
                    </div>


                    <div class="field-grid">
                        <div>
                            <span class="label">Acciones correctivas</span>
                            <div class="choice-row two" id="correctiveRow">
                                <button type="button" class="choice-btn active success-choice" data-corrective="√"><b>√</b><span>Aplicada</span></button>
                                <button type="button" class="choice-btn danger-choice" data-corrective="X"><b>X</b><span>Ausente</span></button>
                            </div>
